Pikmelo Server LX source worker

The LX API capability negotiation and request/utility compatibility in
execute.mjs are adapted from LX Music Desktop by lyswhut and contributors.

Upstream: https://github.com/lyswhut/lx-music-desktop
Reference commit: 323e4bac505da428adae8db6b58039fb2b36b86d
Reference file: src/main/modules/userApi/renderer/preload.js
License: Apache License 2.0, reproduced in LICENSE-LX-Music.txt.

Pikmelo adaptations replace Electron IPC and direct HTTP with a bounded
container worker and short-lived, public-network-only HTTP capabilities.
The host advertises its supported intersection of source capabilities.
